@baseUrl = https://localhost:7150
@organizationId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@session = replace-with-local-browser-session

### Complete activity CSV: same ReadUsage permission as /activity, no secrets/payloads
GET {{baseUrl}}/management/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/usage/export?kind=activity&rowLimit=1000&from=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-10-02T00:00:00Z
Cookie: __Host-uzllm-session={{session}}
Accept: text/csv

### Daily usage CSV: exactly the /timeseries read model, including lag/refund/net
GET {{baseUrl}}/management/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/usage/export?kind=daily&rowLimit=100&from=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-10-02T00:00:00Z
Cookie: __Host-uzllm-session={{session}}
Accept: text/csv

### Invalid export bound: 400. More matching rows than rowLimit: 413, not a truncated CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/management/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/usage/export?rowLimit=5001
Cookie: __Host-uzllm-session={{session}}
